Square Fusion
=============

Square Fusion is a modified version of Square, combined with code and artwork
from BitChord. The combined work is distributed under the GNU General Public
License, version 3 (see LICENSE). No additional terms apply.

Corresponding source: https://github.com/httpsMrAbdelhak/Square_fusion — every
APK published by this repository's workflow names the exact commit it was built
from (release notes, workflow summary, and BuildConfig.SOURCE_COMMIT).


Square
------
Copyright (C) the Square contributors — https://github.com/Lelonio/Square
License: GPL-3.0
Square is the base of this project. Its own third-party notices (librespot,
Bungee, AndroidLiquidGlass, Phosphor Icons, Coil, Spicy Lyrics, OkHttp,
Retrofit, NewPipeExtractor, the Metrolist InnerTube module, yt-dlp ejs,
meriyah, astring, ...) are unchanged and remain listed in the app's
Settings > About > Licences and in the files they come with.

Modifications to Square in this repository (2026, Square Fusion):
  - application id dev.lelonio.square.fusion, name "Square Fusion";
  - YouTube Music as the only playback source; the YouTube/Spotify switch
    removed from the onboarding and the home page;
  - YouTube audio quality tiers (low, medium, high, maximum) in
    backend/youtube/AudioQuality.kt, with hooks in YouTubePlayerFactory and
    SignedInStreams;
  - a Spotify library (playlists, liked songs, followed artists, imported
    playlist links) shown in Square's Library and played through YouTube
    Music, under app/src/main/java/dev/lelonio/square/fusion/spotify/;
  - Square's self-updater pointed at this repository's releases;
  - .github/workflows/fusion.yml (build, emulator tests, publication) and
    .github/workflows/upstream-sync.yml (merges Lelonio/Square daily);
  - small, commented hooks in SettingsScreen, SquareApp, MainViewModel,
    LibraryScreen, HomeScreen, BackendChoiceScreen, PreferencesStore,
    YouTubeDownloads, TouchRefreshRate, SquareApplication and
    AndroidManifest.xml.
  The full history is in this repository's git log.


BitChord
--------
Copyright (C) the BitChord contributors — https://github.com/kushagrasinghx/BitChord
License: GPL-3.0

Code ported or adapted from BitChord (each file says which BitChord file it
comes from and what was changed):
  - Spotify sign-in and library: fusion/spotify/SpotifyFreeLoginScreen.kt
    (auth/SpotifyLoginScreen.kt), SpotifyFreeToken.kt
    (data/canvas/SpotifyToken.kt), SpotifyFreeLibrary.kt and
    SpotifyFreeAccount.kt (shared/.../data/spotify/SpotifyLibrary.kt)
  - fusion/AppIcon.kt (AppIcon.kt)
  - fusion/display/RefreshRates.kt (ui/performance/DisplayRefreshRates.kt)

Artwork copied from BitChord without modification (byte-identical files):
  app/src/main/res/mipmap-*/ic_glass_*.png, ic_liquid_glass*, ic_samsung_glass*,
  ic_pixel_glass*, drawable/ic_launcher_background.xml,
  drawable/ic_launcher_foreground.xml. BitChord's own launcher icon
  (mipmap-anydpi/ic_launcher.xml and mipmap-*/ic_launcher.webp) is included
  under the file name bitchord_ic_launcher, contents unchanged, so that it does
  not replace Square's ic_launcher.

Not ported: BitChord's addon sources, JioSaavn, audio output code and MODULE
system (an earlier Square Fusion build had the first three; they were removed).


New dependencies
----------------
None. The additions use libraries Square already ships (OkHttp,
kotlinx.serialization, kotlinx.coroutines, Media3, AndroidX Security,
the Metrolist InnerTube module).


